{"id":552,"name":"krokorok","speciesId":552,"dex":552,"form":"normal","generation":5,"types":["ground","dark"],"stats":{"hp":60,"attack":82,"defense":45,"special-attack":45,"special-defense":45,"speed":74},"abilities":[{"name":"intimidate","hidden":false},{"name":"moxie","hidden":false},{"name":"anger-point","hidden":true}],"height":10,"weight":334,"baseExp":123,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/552.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/552.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/552.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/552.ogg","genus":"Desert Croc Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Crocodilo do Deserto","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"They live in groups of a few individuals. Protective membranes shield their eyes from sandstorms."},{"version":"white","text":"The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Protected by thin membranes, their eyes can see even in the dead of night. They live in groups of a few individuals."},{"version":"sun","text":"They move in groups of a few individuals. A female is often the leader of the group, and the males will gather food."},{"version":"moon","text":"Thanks to the special membrane covering its eyes, it can see its surroundings clearly, even in the middle of the night."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Krokorok really hates it when its body gets cold. On nights when the temperature drops, it digs deep into the desert sands."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It buries some of its prey in the sand to use as emergency meals when its hunts are unsuccessful."},{"version":"sword","text":"Krokorok has specialized eyes that enable it to see in the dark. This ability lets Krokorok hunt in the dead of night without getting lost."},{"version":"shield","text":"Although this Pokémon has specialized eyes that allow it to see in the dark, Krokorok won’t move much at night—the desert gets cold after sunset."}],"flavorPt":"Embora este Pokémon tenha olhos especializados que lhe permitem ver no escuro, Krokorok não se move muito à noite – o deserto fica frio após o pôr do sol.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":90,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"sandile","speciesId":551,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 29"],"species":"krokorok","speciesId":552,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 40"],"species":"krookodile","speciesId":553,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":552,"name":"krokorok","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/552.png"}],"games":[11,14,15,16,17,18,20,25],"moves":[{"id":5,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":15,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":25,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":28,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[11,"lv",7],[14,"lv",1],[14,"lv",7],[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",7],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",7],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",7],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",7],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":37,"learn":[[11,"lv",52],[14,"lv",52],[15,"lv",52],[16,"lv",52],[17,"lv",52],[18,"lv",52],[20,"lv",47],[25,"lv",47]]},{"id":38,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":43,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":44,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[11,"lv",4],[14,"lv",1],[14,"lv",4],[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",4],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",4],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",4],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",4],[20,"lv",15],[25,"lv",15]]},{"id":46,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":67,"learn":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":70,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"